# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CLIENT env (VITE_*) — these are PUBLIC: Vite inlines them into the browser
# bundle. NEVER put a secret/API key here.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Lead form submission endpoint (Formspree form URL, webhook, or your API).
# Used as the direct/fallback target when the /api/lead pipeline is not
# configured. Example (Formspree): https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx
VITE_LEAD_ENDPOINT=

# Cloudflare Turnstile PUBLIC site key. Optional — leave blank to disable bot
# verification (the form then uses VITE_LEAD_ENDPOINT directly). When set, the
# form submits through the same-origin /api/lead proxy which verifies the token.
VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SERVER env — set these in Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables (NOT here,
# and NOT prefixed with VITE_ so they stay off the client). Listed for reference.
# The lead pipeline is INERT until at least one delivery mode below is set.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# ── LeadOptimizer (GoHighLevel / HighLevel white-label) ──────────────────────
# Provide EITHER the API pair (richer: upsert + tags + dedup + notes) OR the
# inbound-webhook URL (simplest: the workflow does the rest). The adapter prefers
# the API when both the token and location id are present.
#
#   LEADOPTIMIZER_PIT_TOKEN   — HighLevel Private Integration token (API v2)
#   LEADOPTIMIZER_LOCATION_ID — the sub-account / location id the token belongs to
#   LEADOPTIMIZER_WEBHOOK_URL — Inbound Webhook trigger URL (fallback mode)
#   LEADOPTIMIZER_API_BASE    — optional override (default services.leadconnectorhq.com)
#   LEADOPTIMIZER_API_VERSION — optional override (default 2021-07-28)
#
# ── Delivery reliability & ops (all optional) ────────────────────────────────
#   LEAD_BACKUP_WEBHOOK_URL   — failure sink; receives the lead if CRM delivery
#                               fails after retries, so a valid lead is never lost
#   LEAD_NOTIFY_WEBHOOK_URL   — Slack/email webhook pinged on each successful lead
#
# ── Security / other integrations ────────────────────────────────────────────
#   TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY  — Cloudflare Turnstile secret (enables verification)
#   LEAD_ENDPOINT         — optional legacy forward target for /api/lead
#   GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY — enables live Google reviews via /api/reviews
#   GOOGLE_PLACE_ID       — paired with the key above
